  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened institutional capacity of employers&apos; organizations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As a business membership organization, Qatar Chamber of Commerce and Industry (QCCI) main services are focused on trade-related issues. The ILO will provide support to enhance the organizational structure of the Chamber to better advocate and represent the business community in labour and employment-related topics and to effectively participate in the discussion concerning the reforms to laws, systems and procedures undertaken by the Qatar Government.  
Besides, the QCCI has also shown an interest in developing its capacities to better support members in adopting sustainable practices. ILO will support the capacities of the Chamber to develop services enabling their members to understand how to adapt their operations to become sustainable and to understand the complexities of the different reporting mechanisms being developed at national and international levels.</narrative>
  </description>
